GATE="_synthetic"
EXPECT_EXIT="2"
DESCRIPTION="A set -u violation. An unbound variable is a fatal shell error rather than a command failure, so the ERR trap never fires, gate_error never runs, no report is written, and bash exits 1 -- indistinguishable from a finding. Caught now by an EXIT trap installed at source time, which is the only hook that sees every abnormal termination."
